    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοχετ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furnish with channels,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					77c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>distribute by conduits,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				1.33
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωχετευμένων ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					20.8
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of the spinal cord, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. διὰ τῶν σφονδύλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Anat.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, of a country, <i>to be irrigated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.1.5
			</span></i>.</div>
